@startuml classical_resolution
' purpose: shared classical physics and the two approved mutation-guard corrections
' covers: packages/starchess-core/src/engine/classical-resolution.ts
' covers: packages/starchess-core/src/resolve/resolve-turn.ts
' covers: packages/starchess-core/src/resolve/submit-turn.ts
' covers: packages/starchess-core/src/__tests__/engine-consolidation.test.ts
' details: _spec/classical-resolution.md, _spec/game-core.md
' consolidation goal: _spec/engine-consolidation.puml
' status: source consolidated; scoped Bun regression verification passed; native/runtime/training qualifications remain separate
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Classical settlement · shared mutation kernel, scoped Bun verification passed
participant "resolve/submit-turn.ts\nproduct or native-admitted turn" as TURN <<app>>
participant "resolve/resolve-turn.ts\nresolveTurnKernel" as KERNEL <<app>>
participant "board/vision.ts / ray-scan.ts\nshared discovery geometry" as VISION <<app>>
participant "engine/causal-types.ts\noptional ResolutionEffects" as EFFECTS <<app>>

TURN -> KERNEL : physical plans + board + visibility
KERNEL -> KERNEL : capture common initial board
KERNEL -> VISION : evaluate ordered attack / approach rules
VISION --> KERNEL : private discovery result
KERNEL -> KERNEL : retire direct casualties + staged ordered mines
KERNEL -> KERNEL : timed occupant / quiet contacts; landing + chase mines
KERNEL -> KERNEL : apply deferred path attacks to guarded live operands
KERNEL -> KERNEL : delayed departures / swaps; synchronize phase3 mines
KERNEL -> KERNEL : promote only surviving own Marine arrivals
opt Effects supplied for this game
  KERNEL -> EFFECTS : emit at actual mutation sites, not final-state diff
end
KERNEL --> TURN : attack / move / path snapshots + consequences

note over TURN,KERNEL
  Promotion validates the live own Marine rather
  than trusting the queued destination alone.
  Delayed swaps also update phase-three mines
  after each contact, so final results cannot
  resurrect a spent mine.
end note
@enduml
